# UV Package Manager
RULE: Local: uv pip install. Docker/CI: pip or uv (UCS base has uv). Never pip install -e . for local dev.
WHY: uv 10-100x faster; CI may use pip for Artifact Registry keyring.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/dependency-management.md, .cursor/rules/uv-package-manager.mdc
DO: uv pip install -e ".[dev]"; RUN uv pip install --system in Dockerfile; uv lock
NEVER: pip install -e .; pip install ruff; python -m pip install
